===============================================================================
                    ENHANCED LABELS DLL v1.0 (32-BIT)
===============================================================================
 Release Date : September 2026
 Language     : Coded in iwBasic / Win32 API
 Platform     : Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11 (x86/x64)
 Category     : Developer Tools / GUI Custom Controls / DLL Component
 Author       : Yannick Dalissier
 Status       : Freeware / Developer Resource
===============================================================================

 DESCRIPTION:
 ------------
 Lightweight, high-performance Win32 custom control DLL providing 
 extended static label capabilities for IWBasic application development.

 KEY FEATURES:
 -------------
  - Custom Win32 Window Class Registration ("EnhancedLabel")
  - Anti-Flicker Double-Buffered GDI / GDI+ Rendering Architecture
  - Multi-Style Gradient Backgrounds & Custom Alpha Vignettes
  - Configurable Text Alignment, Drop Shadows & Outline Stroke FX
  - Dynamic Hyperlink Hover Effects with Custom Cursor Handlers
  - Zero External Runtime Dependencies (Pure Win32 GDI API)
  - Native API Compatibility across IWBasic 2.5
  - Low CPU Footprint with Complete GDI Object Resource Cleanup

===============================================================================
                [ Ideal for IWBasic Win32 GUI Applications ]
===============================================================================